      "text": "The legbreaker makes a maul Strike against an adjacent creature. If it hits, the creature is knocked Prone and becomes Clumsy 1 for 1 minute. As long as this clumsy condition lasts, the creature also takes a –5-foot penalty to its Speeds and has weakness 5 to the legbreaker's Strikes.\n\nEffect: Break Legs!"
